sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as 🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Patient
    participant PP as 📱 Patient Portal
    participant MS as 📹 Meeting Server
    participant WS as 🔌 Socket.IO
    participant JITSI as 🎥 Jitsi Meet
    participant WSA as 🎤 Web Speech API
    participant AI as 🤖 Gemini AI
    participant DP as 💻 Doctor Portal
    participant D as 👨‍⚕️ Doctor
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over P,D: 📋 CONSENT & AGREEMENT
        D->>DP: Start consultation
        DP->>MS: Create meeting room
        MS-->>DP: Room ID + invite link
        D->>DP: Share invite to patient
        DP->>DB: Store meeting record
        P->>PP: Click invite / Join Meeting
        PP->>PP: Show consent agreement
        P->>PP: Accept recording consent
    end

    rect rgb(224, 247, 250)
        Note over P,D: 🚪 LOBBY & AUTHENTICATION
        PP->>MS: Request JWT token
        MS-->>PP: JWT for patient
        PP->>WS: Connect Socket.IO
        PP->>JITSI: Join room (JWT) → Lobby
        WS->>DP: Patient waiting in lobby
        D->>DP: Admit / Reject patient
        DP->>WS: Lobby response (admit)
        WS->>PP: Lobby admitted
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over PP,JITSI: 🎥 VIDEO CONNECTION
        PP->>JITSI: Enter room (admitted)
        DP->>JITSI: Already in room
        JITSI-->>PP: Room joined
        JITSI->>JITSI: WebRTC P2P established
        PP->>PP: Camera + Mic active
        DP->>DP: Camera + Mic active
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 225)
        Note over PP,AI: 🎤 REAL-TIME TRANSCRIPTION (Browser)
        D->>DP: Enable transcription
        loop Continuous speech recognition
            DP->>WSA: Start Web Speech API
            WSA-->>DP: Speech → Text (interim)
            WSA-->>DP: Speech → Text (final)
            DP->>WS: Send transcript segment
            WS->>MS: Broadcast transcript
            MS->>DB: Store transcript segment
            WS->>PP: Live transcript update
        end
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over D,AI: 🤖 AI SUMMARY GENERATION
        D->>DP: End consultation
        DP->>MS: Request AI summary
        MS->>DB: Get full transcript
        DB-->>MS: Transcript data
        MS->>AI: Generate SOAP summary (Gemini 2.5 Flash)
        AI-->>MS: SOAP suggestions + clinical notes
        MS-->>DP: AI summary response
        DP->>D: Display SOAP suggestions
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over D,DB: 📋 EMR DOCUMENTATION
        D->>DP: Review & edit SOAP notes
        D->>DP: Add prescriptions + lab orders
        D->>DP: Digital signature
        DP->>DB: Save encounter record (EMR)
        DP->>DB: Save prescriptions
        DP->>DB: Save lab/imaging orders
        DB->>PP: Notify patient
        PP->>P: "Records available" notification
    end
